{"id": "EUVD-2026-16336", "enisaUuid": "4c507695-4179-37bb-ad11-490667be0af6", "description": "A flaw was found in p11-kit. A remote attacker could exploit this vulnerability by calling the C_DeriveKey function on a remote token with specific IBM kyber or IBM btc derive mechanism parameters set to NULL. This could lead to the RPC-client attempting to return an uninitialized value, potentially resulting in a NULL dereference or undefined behavior. This issue may cause an application level denial of service or other unpredictable system states.", "datePublished": "2026-03-26T20:01:46", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T19:24:02", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:L", "references": ["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:18143", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:18599", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:21275", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:22634", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:27998", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:58981", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:7065", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:72502", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:82304", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:82322", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:82347", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:82354", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:82372", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:82857", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:82888", "https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-2100", "https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2437308", "https://github.com/p11-glue/p11-kit/pull/740", "https://github.com/p11-glue/p11-kit/releases/tag/0.26.2"], "aliases": ["GHSA-hq85-3f6c-jx84", "CVE-2026-2100"], "assigner": "redhat", "epss": 1.26, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "160fbf16-a2c6-3845-9828-7b287d2de872", "product": {"name": "Cert Manager support for Red Hat OpenShift release 1.18", "vendor": {"